r with every win!</p>","developers":["Noah Magner"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808810/abf91443f23cec3d76c1e603506135050bbc9e71/header.jpg?t=1773252320","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808810/164615513/8be1b514d93201550c80b7bc577b434a0bbd142a/1772709480/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772710499","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808810/164615513/8be1b514d93201550c80b7bc577b434a0bbd142a/1772709480/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772710499","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808810/164615513/8be1b514d93201550c80b7bc577b434a0bbd142a/1772709480/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772710499","id":257298218,"name":"Prismarch - The Exchange Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257298218/c72beef7d965caff9b55a04067e6d08f9fba03fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772710499"}],"name":"Prismarch","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 (3.1 GHz) or AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GT 640 or AMD Radeon HD 7750 (1 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage